# Vercel serves docs/ as the site root (see vercel.json outputDirectory), which means
# every file under it is a public URL. These are working documents, not pages, and they
# were reachable at buki.vercel.app/superpowers/plans/... until this file existed.
#
# Nothing here holds a secret. It holds the plan: pricing strategy, trial mechanics, the
# names of the server environment variables, and store copy that is currently marked
# STALE and would be actively misleading if a reviewer or a customer found it first.
#
# If you add a document under docs/, decide whether it is a page. If it is not, add it.
docs/superpowers
docs/store
docs/brand.md

